ShortDescription: Reports this computer's processor, memory, disk and network health to a GWatch server.
Description: |-
  The GWatch Agent is the small program that goes on the machines you want a GWatch server to watch.
  It reads this computer's processor, memory, disk and network health and sends it to GWatch every minute.
  It only ever connects outwards: GWatch is given no way into this computer, and the credential the agent holds can do one thing, submit this machine's readings.
  Installed with winget, it is kept up to date by winget (winget upgrade GWatch.Agent) and never replaces itself.
Moniker: gwatch-agent
Tags:
