ReleaseNotesUrl: https://github.com/jxburros/GWatch/releases/tag/agent-v@VERSION@
InstallationNotes: |-
  Pair this machine with GWatch to start reporting. Get a code in GWatch under Nodes > Pair a machine, then either install with it:
    winget install GWatch.Agent --override "/VERYSILENT /SUPPRESSMSGBOXES /SERVER=https://gwatch.lan:7230 /CODE=XXXX-XXXX"
  or, after a plain install, from an Administrator prompt:
    "%ProgramFiles%\GWatch Agent\gwatch-agent.exe" install --server https://gwatch.lan:7230 --code XXXX-XXXX
